@startuml production
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction
title LazyFinance — Production Deployment\n<color:#991B1B>PROPOSED TOPOLOGY · NOT DEPLOYED</color>

node "<b>Browser</b>\nStatic bundle + direct API requests" as Browser <<boundary>>
node "External MCP client" as Client <<external client>>

node " " as Runtime {
  node "<b>Public DNS / TLS ingress</b>\nHTTPS :443 · host routing · rate limits" as Edge <<boundary>>
  node "<b>Static UI</b>\nPrerender + private CSR\nNo API proxy or session data" as UI <<boundary>>
  node "<b>NestJS API · private upstream</b>\nPublic tRPC, assistant, OAuth and MCP\nOne API replica for initial voice support" as API <<application>>
  node "<b>Private persistence</b>\nVerified assertions and restricted SQL login\nNo demo tools" as Persistence <<persistence>>
  database "<b>Private PostgreSQL 18</b>\nScoped, forced RLS on sensitive tables\nNo public route" as DB
  artifact "<b>One-shot migration job</b>\nSeparate owner credential" as Migrate
}

component "<b>External providers</b>\nFirebase Auth · optional Fintoc\nOptional text model / OpenAI Realtime" as Providers <<adapter>>
artifact "<b>Approved release</b>\nTested image digests + migration plan" as Release <<security>>
artifact "<b>Encrypted backup store</b>\nOff-host recovery and PITR" as Backup

Browser --> Edge : HTTPS UI and API origins
Client --> Edge : HTTPS OAuth / MCP
Edge --> UI : app.example.com
Edge --> API : api.example.com
API --> Persistence : signed tRPC over private TLS
Persistence --> DB : scoped SQL over private TLS
API ..> Providers : scoped HTTPS / WSS egress
Release ..> Migrate : approval gates rollout
Migrate ..> DB : migrate / provision
DB --> Backup : encrypted backups / WAL

legend bottom
  The shaded box is the production runtime, isolated from development identities, data and secrets.
  Example hostnames share a browser site. Only ingress is public; no backend ports are published.
  Firebase sign-in, the Fintoc Widget and optional WebRTC media have separate browser paths.
  Demo tools and automatic bank sync stay off at first release. Verify telemetry and restores.
  No hosting provider, autoscaling, high availability or launch approval is implied.
endlegend
@enduml
